# Provenance Map
#
# Deliberately narrow. Producer photographs, the carousel exports and the
# PowerShell tools all belong in the repo, so nothing here touches them.
# This only keeps out things a machine generated that the site never serves.

# Browser "Save page as, Complete webpage" asset folders. One of these held
# 38mb of Meta's own JavaScript from a saved Facebook page.
*_files/

# Finished artwork and zips produced for a post or a print job. They are
# deliverables rather than site files, and the map never loads them.
Claude outputs/

# Local editor and machine config. The skills in .claude stay committed.
.claude/launch.json
.claude/settings.local.json

# OS and editor noise
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
desktop.ini
*.bak
*.tmp
